- future_lost: total lost for the scenario only (i.e., through all future_schedule events). Do not include historical lost. So sum of lost from demands in future_schedule.

- first_future_stockout_time: earliest future event time with unmet demand, or -1 if none. We should look at future_schedule events that produce a stockout (i.e., demand > available stock). That might happen in some event. We need to record the earliest event_time among them. If none, -1.

